{"unit_id":"chenjrastro-tech__github-release-download-acceleration#card-zh","repo":"chenjrastro-tech/github-release-download-acceleration","commit":"17539f09a5eca1648d4100c26defa42504c2b63d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"github-release-download-acceleration 是把 GitHub Release 大文件下载技能接入 DSH 的插件。它通过技能 provider 加载包内 SKILL.md，并提供 Windows PowerShell 与 POSIX runner。技能会探测代理和镜像路线、测速选路，对适合的大文件测试并发，再以 Range 分段下载、续传并核对字节数和 SHA256。适合下载 GitHub 发布资产较慢或中断的用户；运行需要本机 curl，Windows 使用 PowerShell 5.1，且下载时需要访问 GitHub 或可用镜像。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:36-37","index.js:142-151","SKILL.md:15-24","scripts/ghdl.sh:1-7"]}
